# Saved reference profiles. Local only, deliberately and permanently.
#
# A profile is measurements taken from a recording someone owns, and which recordings a
# person has is their business. There is also no reason for it to travel: a profile is
# generated from a file on that machine in about a second, so committing one shares a
# fact about its author and saves nobody any work.
#
# `app.config.profile_dir` defaults here for the same reason, and a test asserts this
# line still covers it - see tests/test_reference_profile.py.
profiles/
